$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=holnid2  LOC_AFTER=?

* The local identity theorem ~ holid2c at a point of a rectangle nested at distance R inside the domain: a holomorphic function vanishing on some disc about the point vanishes on the disc of radius R / 2 about it.

